A voice booooms out: Welcome to the test chamber.

Type "help" to repeat this message, "quit" to exit, "seed N" to set the RNG seed, or "print" to print some random numbers. ("print N" will print that many; otherwise you get twenty of them.) You can also say "range N" to print twenty numbers in the range 0 to -1, or "nrange N" to print in the range -N+1 to 0. ("range 0" or "nrange 0" are the same as "print".)

